# Always on. Git clone/pull/push plus a usable GitHub web UI.
#
# Hostname-exact on purpose: api.githubcopilot.com is a CNAME to
# glb-*.github.com which lands in 140.82.112.0/20, so anything CIDR-based
# would re-enable Copilot. See deny.list.
#
# NOTE: each entry matches the name AND all of its subdomains, so `github.com`
# below permits every *.github.com host. Name unwanted ones in deny.list.
# The githubusercontent.com entry is deliberately the single `avatars.` host,
# not the parent, so raw./codeload-style siblings stay denied.
github.com
ssh.github.com
api.github.com
github.githubassets.com
avatars.githubusercontent.com
